pm i

[WARNING] You are at the monorepo root. This will install ALL packages.

Workspace packages:
├── packages/
│   ├── core "@myapp/core"
│   └── utils "@myapp/utils"
└── apps/
    └── web "@myapp/web"

To install a specific package:
  pm i -F <package-name>

To install everything:
